# React / TSX (PLOS `src`)

## Styling

- Prefer **Tailwind CSS 4** utility classes over hand-written CSS.
- Global tokens live in `src/styles/main.css` `@theme` (semantic: `app-bg` `surface` `subtle` `line` `ink-1..3` `accent` `state-*`). Reuse those tokens (`bg-surface`, `text-ink-2`, …); avoid scattering new hex values.
- Reuse `src/components/primitives.tsx`（`Section`、`KnowledgeRow`、`EvidenceRow`、`ActionCard`、`Card`、`Stat`、`DeltaBadge`）and `src/components/layout/AppShell.tsx`（`PageContainer`）before inventing new atoms.
- State semantic colors (mastered/learning/weak/idle/failed) apply to **dot/badges only**, not full backgrounds.
- Do not add Ant Design, Radix/shadcn, Emotion/styled-components, or ahooks.

## Language

- **Talk to the user in 中文.**
- **Comments:** follow the file (repo defaults to 中文注释).
- **User-facing copy:** always via `src/i18n` (`useI18n`, `messages/zh.ts` + `messages/en.ts` pairs) — never hardcode.

## Tooling

- Do not add demo pages or extra README files unless the user asks.
- Prefer existing stores/hooks (`src/stores/*`, feature hooks) over new global state.
- Keep files ≤ 700 lines; split by responsibility.

